---
import Layout from '@layouts/LayoutMapas.astro';
---

<Layout title="Selección de Plano | Revalora Circular">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center p-4 relative overflow-hidden">
    
    {/* Background Effects */}
    <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-accent-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl w-full">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 px-4 pt-14">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-tight">
          Distribución de <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-400 to-accent-400">Plantas Virtuales CEDA</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Selecciona el modelo que deseas visualizar para acceder al recorrido interactivo 3D y conocer en detalle la distribución y procesos.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 px-4">
        {/* Card 1200m² */}
        <a href="/mapas/1200" class="group relative block h-80 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-500 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-brand-500/20">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/50 to-transparent z-10"></div>
          
          {/* Placeholder Image or Gradient */}
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-800 to-gray-900 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700">
            {/* Abstract Grid Pattern */}
            <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#ffffff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-8 z-20 w-full">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-end">
              <div>
                <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-300 text-xs font-mono mb-3 border border-brand-500/30">
                  MODELO ESTÁNDAR
                </span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">Planta CEDA 1200m²</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm line-clamp-2">
                  Distribución compacta optimizada para eficiencia operativa en proceso de prueba piloto.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-full backdrop-blur-sm group-hover:bg-brand-500 group-hover:text-black transition-all duration-300">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        {/* Card 3000m² */}
        <a href="/mapas/3000" class="group relative block h-80 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-500 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-accent-500/20">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/50 to-transparent z-10"></div>
          
          {/* Placeholder Image or Gradient */}
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-bl from-gray-800 to-gray-900 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700">
             {/* Abstract Grid Pattern */}
             <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#ffffff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-8 z-20 w-full">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-end">
              <div>
                <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-accent-500/20 text-accent-300 text-xs font-mono mb-3 border border-accent-500/30">
                  MODELO EXTENDIDO
                </span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-accent-400 transition-colors">Planta CEDA 3000m²</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm line-clamp-2">
                  Infraestructura a gran escala con doble línea de procesamiento y zonas ampliadas.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-full backdrop-blur-sm group-hover:bg-accent-500 group-hover:text-black transition-all duration-300">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
